      "value": "HIPAA compliance sounds complicated, and I've spent a whole minute looking into it: https://www.reddit.com/r/webhosting/comments/1mf83cv/hipaa_compliant_web_hosting_services/\n\nI guess they could spin off a hipaa compliant version?",
