  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi there! I won't go too in the weeds, but I am a telehealth patient for psychotherapy, and while we were discussing VRC my therapist asked if VRChat supported end-to-end encryption. I don't even know if this as a possibility has been even remotely considered, but I thought I'd inject it into the space. There may be an untapped market for this sort of thing that VRChat could fill.",
